posts = [
  (190,'energy-vape-labels-what-images-can-and-cannot-prove','2026-10-24','Energy Vape Labels: What a Product Photo Can and Cannot Prove','Energie-Vape-Etiketten: Was ein Produktfoto belegen kann und was nicht','ملصقات فيب الطاقة: ما الذي تثبته الصورة وما الذي لا تثبته',
   'energy vape label, product photo verification, disposable vape ingredients, Red Bull vape image, vape authenticity',
   'energy vape Etikett, Produktfoto prüfen, Einweg-E-Zigarette Inhaltsstoffe, Vape Echtheit',
   'ملصق فيب الطاقة، التحقق من صورة المنتج، مكونات السيجارة الإلكترونية، أصالة المنتج',
   'A product photograph can show visible wording, colours, a stated puff count and a warning panel. It cannot by itself prove who manufactured the device, whether a brand authorised the mark, or whether the liquid contains caffeine, taurine or nicotine at a stated concentration. Those questions require the original pack, a traceable manufacturer and reliable laboratory or regulatory records.\n\nThe supplied images show Red Bull marks, flavour or edition wording, an 1800-puff claim and French nicotine warnings. They do not establish a commercial relationship with Red Bull, a complete ingredient list or permission to sell in the United States, Europe or the Middle East.\n\nFor adult readers researching an energy vape, the useful search terms are label verification, ingredient disclosure, nicotine concentration, batch traceability and local market notification. These terms are more precise than treating an energy-drink logo as proof of an energy ingredient.'),
  (191,'caffeine-vape-inhaled-caffeine-evidence-check','2026-10-25','Caffeine Vape and Inhaled Caffeine: Why Ingredient Evidence Matters','Koffein-Vape und inhaliertes Koffein: Warum der Inhaltsstoffnachweis zählt','فيب الكافيين والكافيين المستنشق: لماذا يهم إثبات المكونات',
   'caffeine vape, inhaled caffeine, caffeine pen, energy vape ingredients, vape safety evidence',
   'Koffein-Vape, inhaliertes Koffein, Koffein-Pen, Energie-Vape Inhaltsstoffe',
   'فيب الكافيين، الكافيين المستنشق، قلم الكافيين، مكونات فيب الطاقة',
   'The phrase caffeine vape is used online for several different ideas: a nicotine vape with an energy-drink flavour, a device claimed to contain caffeine, and a non-nicotine inhalation product. They are not interchangeable. A flavour name is not evidence that caffeine is present.\n\nThe FDA has warned that inhaled wellness products can make unproven claims and that inhaled ingredients or impurities may create respiratory risks. Its warning letter to a caffeine-pen company also shows why a product intended for inhalation cannot simply be treated as an ordinary dietary supplement.\n\nA responsible article should therefore ask for the exact ingredient list, concentration, intended route, manufacturer identity and adverse-event information. It should not describe an unverified image as a safe source of energy or mental alertness.'),
  (192,'taurine-vape-claims-and-ingredient-transparency','2026-10-26','Taurine Vape Claims: Separating a Flavour Story from an Ingredient List','Taurin-Vape-Versprechen: Geschmacksgeschichte und Zutatenliste trennen','ادعاءات فيب التورين: الفصل بين وصف النكهة وقائمة المكونات',
   'taurine vape, taurine inhalation, energy vape claims, ingredient transparency, vape label review',
   'Taurin-Vape, Taurin-Inhalation, Energie-Vape-Versprechen, Zutaten-Transparenz',
   'فيب التورين، استنشاق التورين، ادعاءات فيب الطاقة، شفافية المكونات',
   'Taurine is strongly associated with energy drinks, but that association does not show that taurine is present in a vape liquid or that inhalation is safe. Online product names often borrow familiar drink language without publishing a complete composition.\n\nThe correct check is documentary: look for a full ingredient list, batch information, responsible manufacturer and a jurisdiction-specific product notification or authorisation where required. Marketing phrases such as energy, vitality or focus should not be treated as toxicology evidence.\n\nFor the pictured devices, taurine is not visible on the supplied packaging. The safest description is therefore “taurine claim not verified,” not “taurine vape.”'),
  (193,'red-bull-vape-trademark-authorization-check','2026-10-27','Red Bull-Marked Vape Images: Trademark, Authenticity and Authorization Checks','Vape-Bilder mit Red-Bull-Kennzeichen: Marke, Echtheit und Genehmigung prüfen','صور فيب تحمل علامة ريد بُل: فحص العلامة والأصالة والتفويض',
   'Red Bull vape, trademark authorization, counterfeit vape warning, branded disposable vape, authenticity check',
   'Red Bull Vape, Markengenehmigung, gefälschte Vape-Warnung, Marken-Einweg-Vape',
   'فيب ريد بُل، تفويض العلامة التجارية، تحذير من المنتجات المقلدة، فحص الأصالة',
   'A familiar logo on a vape is not proof that the trademark owner made or approved the device. The Red Bull website presents its energy-drink business, while third-party vape listings use similar wording for flavours and devices. That mismatch is a reason to verify, not a reason to infer authorization.\n\nBuyers, publishers and retailers should request written authorization, a traceable manufacturer, a genuine batch record and a market-specific compliance file. If those documents are unavailable, the image should be described as an unverified branded appearance.\n\nThis distinction also protects readers from confusing a flavour reference with an actual beverage product or an approved energy-delivery system.'),
  (194,'fda-energy-vape-wellness-claims','2026-10-28','FDA Energy Vape and Wellness Claims: What the Warning Record Shows','FDA zu Energie-Vapes und Wellness-Versprechen: Was die Warnungen zeigen','فيب الطاقة وادعاءات العافية لدى FDA: ماذا تظهر التحذيرات',
   'FDA energy vape warning, wellness vape claims, caffeine pen FDA, vaping health claims, inhaled product risk',
   'FDA Energie-Vape-Warnung, Wellness-Vape-Versprechen, Koffein-Pen FDA',
   'تحذير FDA من فيب الطاقة، ادعاءات العافية، قلم الكافيين، مخاطر المنتجات المستنشقة',
   'The FDA states that no vaping products are approved to prevent or treat a health condition or disease. It has also taken action against vaping products marketed with unproven wellness claims, including claims about mental clarity and disease treatment.\n\nThat record matters for energy-type content because words such as focus, alertness, wellness and energy can turn a flavour or lifestyle description into a health claim. A product page should not promise a cognitive effect, a safer inhalation route or a therapeutic benefit.\n\nFor the pictured products, the compliant editorial approach is to report visible wording and identify missing evidence rather than repeat an energy or performance promise.'),
  (195,'eu-tpd-caffeine-taurine-electronic-cigarette-rules','2026-10-29','EU TPD and Caffeine or Taurine in Electronic Cigarettes','EU-TPD und Koffein oder Taurin in elektronischen Zigaretten','قواعد TPD الأوروبية والكافيين أو التورين في السجائر الإلكترونية',
   'EU TPD caffeine vape, EU TPD taurine vape, Article 7(6) additives, electronic cigarette ingredients Europe',
   'EU-TPD Koffein-Vape, EU-TPD Taurin-Vape, Artikel 7 Absatz 6 Zusatzstoffe',
   'TPD الأوروبي فيب الكافيين، فيب التورين، إضافات المادة 7(6)، مكونات السجائر الإلكترونية',
   'Article 20 of the EU Tobacco Products Directive requires nicotine-containing liquid to meet specific conditions and excludes additives listed in Article 7(6). The Directive also addresses additives that create an impression of health benefits or increased mental alertness and physical performance.\n\nThis does not create one simple Europe-wide sales answer for every pictured device. Member-state implementation, product notification, nicotine concentration, packaging and national advertising rules still matter.\n\nA keyword such as EU caffeine vape should therefore lead to a compliance explanation, not a promise that an unverified energy-labelled disposable device can be sold across the EU.'),
  (196,'france-vape-warning-label-energy-drink-packaging','2026-10-30','French Vape Warning Labels: Reading the Packaging Without Overclaiming','Französische Vape-Warnhinweise: Verpackungen ohne Übertreibung lesen','تحذيرات الفيب الفرنسية: قراءة العبوة دون مبالغة',
   'France vape warning label, French nicotine warning, energy drink vape packaging, vape packaging review',
   'Frankreich Vape-Warnhinweis, französischer Nikotinwarnhinweis, Vape-Verpackung',
   'تحذير الفيب في فرنسا، تحذير النيكوتين الفرنسي، عبوة فيب مشروب الطاقة',
   'The photographs show French warning text stating that the product contains nicotine and that nicotine is addictive. That is useful evidence about visible packaging, but it is not a complete compliance file. A warning panel does not verify the manufacturer, nicotine concentration, liquid volume, notification status or authenticity of a logo.\n\nWhen reviewing an energy-drink-style vape, record the exact language, edition name, stated puff count and warnings separately. Do not translate “energy drink” into a claim that the aerosol contains caffeine or provides energy.\n\nThis approach helps searchers looking for French vape labels while avoiding an unsupported conclusion about legal sale or product performance.'),
  (197,'middle-east-energy-vape-regulatory-checklist','2026-10-31','Middle East Energy Vape Research: A Country-by-Country Checklist','Energie-Vapes im Nahen Osten: Checkliste nach Ländern','بحث فيب الطاقة في الشرق الأوسط: قائمة تحقق لكل دولة',
   'Middle East energy vape regulations, UAE vape compliance, Saudi vape rules, Gulf nicotine product check',
   'Nahost Energie-Vape-Regeln, VAE Vape-Compliance, Saudi-Vape-Regeln',
   'لوائح فيب الطاقة في الشرق الأوسط، امتثال الفيب في الإمارات، قواعد الفيب في السعودية',
   'The Middle East is not one regulatory market. Import controls, tobacco or nicotine classification, product conformity, excise treatment, labelling and online sales rules can differ by country. A device shown in a social-media image cannot be assumed to be lawful in the UAE, Saudi Arabia, Bahrain, Oman or another market.\n\nResearch should begin with the destination authority, not with a seller’s product title. Check whether the product category is defined, whether nicotine and ingredients must be disclosed, whether a conformity certificate or tax marking is required and whether online promotion is restricted.\n\nFor an unverified Red Bull-marked image, the correct status is “country-specific verification required.”'),
  (198,'energy-drink-vape-nicotine-caffeine-confusion','2026-11-01','Energy Drink Vape, Nicotine and Caffeine: Three Claims That Must Stay Separate','Energy-Drink-Vape, Nikotin und Koffein: Drei getrennte Aussagen','فيب مشروب الطاقة والنيكوتين والكافيين: ثلاث ادعاءات يجب فصلها',
   'energy drink vape nicotine caffeine, vape ingredient confusion, nicotine label, caffeine vape verification',
   'Energy-Drink-Vape Nikotin Koffein, Vape-Inhaltsstoffverwechslung, Nikotin-Etikett',
   'فيب مشروب الطاقة والنيكوتين والكافيين، خلط مكونات الفيب، ملصق النيكوتين',
   'Energy-drink flavour, nicotine presence and caffeine content are three different questions. A product can reference an energy drink flavour while containing nicotine, no caffeine or an unknown mixture. The supplied photos show nicotine warnings but do not show a caffeine quantity or a taurine declaration.\n\nReaders should not calculate a caffeine dose from puff count, flavour name or the colour of a package. They should also not assume that a nicotine warning covers every other ingredient risk.\n\nClear editorial wording is simple: “nicotine warning visible; caffeine and taurine not verified; manufacturer and authorization not verified.”'),
  (199,'how-to-report-unverified-energy-vape-listing','2026-11-02','How to Report an Unverified Energy Vape Listing or Image','So meldet man ein ungeprüftes Energie-Vape-Angebot oder Bild','كيفية الإبلاغ عن عرض أو صورة فيب طاقة غير موثقة',
   'report unverified vape listing, counterfeit vape report, energy vape safety complaint, vape adverse event',
   'ungeprüftes Vape-Angebot melden, gefälschte Vape melden, Energie-Vape-Beschwerde',
   'الإبلاغ عن عرض فيب غير موثق، الإبلاغ عن فيب مقلد، شكوى سلامة فيب الطاقة',
   'Keep the original URL, screenshots, seller identity, batch details, warning text and purchase records. Do not alter the product or attempt to test an unknown liquid at home. If someone experiences a serious reaction, stop exposure and seek medical help; in the United States, serious adverse events can be reported to the FDA.\n\nA report should distinguish an alleged counterfeit trademark, a missing ingredient list, a suspected nicotine mismatch and a health reaction. These are different signals and may go to different authorities.\n\nThis is a consumer-information process, not an endorsement of the product. It is especially important for energy-labelled disposable devices whose caffeine, taurine and authorization status cannot be confirmed from photographs.'),
]

